{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-92-1","title":"Psalms 92:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The prophet exhorts to praise God, 4 for his great works; 6 for his judgments on the wicked; 10 and for his goodness to the godly.</p>\n<p>A.M. cir 3464. B.C. cir 540. (Title.) A Psalm.Calmet and others suppose this Psalm to have been composed by some of the Levites during or near the close of the Babylonian captivity, acknowledging the mercy of God, and foreseeing the destruction of their enemies, and their own return to Jerusalem and the temple service.</p>\n<p>for. Isa 58:13,14; Heb 4:9; *marg: Re 4:8-11 good. 33:1; 50:23; 52:9; 54:6; 73:28; 107:1,8,15,21,22; 135:3; 147:1 Eph 5:19; Heb 13:15 most. 8; 82:6; Isa 57:15; Da 4:34-37; 5:18; Ac 7:48,49</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-2","title":"Psalms 92:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>shew. 71:15; 89:1,2; 145:2; Isa 63:7; La 3:22,23; Joh 1:17 every night. Heb. in the nights. 42:8; 77:2; Job 35:10; Ac 16:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-3","title":"Psalms 92:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>instrument. 33:2; 57:8; 68:25; 81:2,3; 149:3; 150:3-5; 1Ch 15:16; 25:6; 2Ch 23:5 2Ch 29:25 the harp, etc. or, the solemn sound with the harp. a solemnsound. Heb. Higgaion. 9:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-4","title":"Psalms 92:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>64:10; 104:31,34; 106:47,48; 126:3; 145:6,7; Isa 61:2-11; 65:13,14 Isa 66:10,11; Jer 31:7,11-13; Zep 3:14-16; Lu 1:47; Joh 16:22 2Co 2:14; Re 18:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-5","title":"Psalms 92:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>O Lord. 40:5; 66:3; 104:24; 111:2; 145:3,4; Re 15:3 thoughts. 139:17; Isa 28:29; 55:8,9; Jer 23:20; Ro 11:33,34 deep. 64:6; Ec 7:24; 1Co 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-6","title":"Psalms 92:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>A brutish. 32:9; 73:22; 94:8; Pr 30:2; Isa 1:3; Jer 10:14; 1Co 2:14 a fool. 14:1; 49:10; 75:4; Pr 1:22; 24:7; Lu 12:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-7","title":"Psalms 92:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>wicked. 37:1,2,35,38; 90:5,6; 103:15,16; Isa 37:27; 40:6,7; Jas 1:10,11 1Pe 1:24 workers. 73:12,18-20; Job 12:6; 21:7-12; Jer 12:1,2; Mal 3:15; 4:1 it is that. 37:35,36,38; 73:18-20; 1Sa 25:36-38; Pr 1:32; Lu 16:19-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-8","title":"Psalms 92:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>art most. 56:2; 83:18; 102:26,27; Ex 18:11; Ec 5:8; Da 4:34,35; Ac 12:1,22-24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-9","title":"Psalms 92:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>For. 21:8,9; 37:20; 68:1,2; 73:27; 89:10; Jud 5:31; Lu 19:27; 2Th 1:7-9 scattered. 1:4; 59:11; 68:30; Le 26:33; Nu 10:35; De 28:64; Isa 17:13; Eze 5:12 Mt 7:23; Lu 21:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-10","title":"Psalms 92:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>But. 89:17,24; 112:9; 132:17; 148:14; 1Sa 2:1,10; Lu 1:69 an unicorn. Nu 23:22; 24:8; 1Jo 2:20 I shall. 23:5; 45:7; 2Co 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-11","title":"Psalms 92:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>37:34; 54:7; 59:10; 91:8; 112:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-12","title":"Psalms 92:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>righteous. 7; 52:8; Isa 55:13; 65:22; Ho 14:5,6 cedar. 104:16; 148:9; Am 2:9 See notes on 1 Ki 4:33; 6:29.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-13","title":"Psalms 92:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Those. Isa 60:21; Ro 6:5; 11:17; Eph 3:17 shall flourish. Isa 61:3; 2Pe 3:18 in the. 100:4; 135:2; 2Ch 4:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-14","title":"Psalms 92:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>They. 1:3; Mt 3:10; Joh 15:2-5; Ga 5:22,23; Php 1:11; Jude 1:12 in old age. 71:18; 1Ch 29:1-30; Job 17:9; Pr 4:18; Isa 46:4; Jer 17:8 flourishing. Heb. green. Eze 47:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-92-15","title":"Psalms 92:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":92,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":92,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>To shew. Joh 10:27-29; 15:1-3; 1Co 1:8,9; 1Th 5:23,24; Tit 1:2; 1Pe 1:4,5 my rock. 18:2; 62:6; De 32:4 and. 145:17; Zep 3:5; Ro 9:14; 2Th 1:6,7</p>"}]}